# Optional maintenance-mode USB ID block list.
#
# Add one USB vendor:product ID per line.  If any listed device is present
# during login, Pixel Challenge autostart is cancelled.
#
# To identify a USB mouse/dongle:
#   1. Run: lsusb
#   2. Unplug the dongle
#   3. Run: lsusb again
#   4. Add the ID that disappeared, for example:
#
# 046d:c52b
